--- notes/layout.txt ---
     1	evd holds descriptions. intake/current.ledger is the mill roster. emitters hold kdec tables.
     2	frames hold packed samples. forgekit is the C pipeline.

--- notes/ops.txt ---
     1	After adding a description, mill may leave decode unknown even though discovery refreshed the on-disk ledger.
     2	Unknown decode is normal for frames that have no description on this bench.

